### ✅ ASP vs ASP.NET vs .NET কী?

ASP: Active Server Page
VS
.NET (pronounced "dot net") is a free, open-source, cross-platform developer platform/framework created by Microsoft.
Think of it as a massive digital construction kit. 
It provides the tools, programming languages, and pre-built code libraries needed to build almost any type of application—including web, mobile, desktop, gaming, and IoT.


