FRAMWORK: 
-Ready-made tools(routing, databases, logins)
Instead of writing code from scratch to handle basic web functions
—like routing URLs, managing user logins, or connecting to databases
—ASP.NET provides all of that infrastructure out of the box. 
You just write the specific logic for your app.

Analogy:
Think of a framework like buying a fully furnished smart house.
The plumbing, electricity, security system, and Wi-Fi are already installed and Ready-made tools(routing, databases, logins). 
All you have to do is show up, hang your personal photos, and arrange the furniture (your specific app logic).
